.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-project-delete - Delete a project


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro project delete  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a project

.PP
Only the project is deleted: its services go back to the default project, nothing else changes. Writes: 60 per minute per key (429 \fBrate_limited\fR). Sub-account keys cannot create, rename or delete projects (403 \fBsubkey_forbidden\fR).

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/projects/{id} (operationId deleteProject, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete

.PP
